#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0381 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "THE LOAD-BEARING-GUARD PIN (finding AD0381-F1). BTOXGRN not declared, no other pair present. Data would fire under the degraded key (regroup on [PARAMCD] alone, flag minority GRADE4 row), but the rule is silent because var_exists(BTOXGRN) is false in arm 1, and the other four arms are dead because their character members are absent (not empty(...) is broadcast FALSE over an absent column). Here, unlike on PMDA-AD0324, the presence guard IS the operative conjunct, because BTOXGRN has no emptiness sibling."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PARAMCD  type=Char
col BTOXGR   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | GRADE3
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | GLUC | GRADE3
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1034 | GLUC | GRADE4
